    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_phase2_substrate.concrete_anchor#shelltask" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_phase2_substrate_concrete_anchor#shelltask silm:hasLongDescription "The ShellTask is the Mittens vaccination record FVRCP-2026-03-15, entering as a typed evidence packet with provenance and validation envelope. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{ShellTask}  \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
