silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_phase2_substrate_concrete_anchor#_ silm:hasLongDescription "The \\ is the Mittens coat-pattern observation (torbie, three-color) entering as a typed quality-claim into the manifest profile reader. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
