    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_phase2_substrate.concrete_anchor#probe" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_phase2_substrate_concrete_anchor#probe silm:hasLongDescription "The Probe is the Felis catus / TSN 183798 taxonomy source leg, recoverable as a typed leg into D_Mittens but not interchangeable with the colimit apex Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{Probe}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
