    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_phase2_substrate.concrete_anchor#tracewitness" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_phase2_substrate_concrete_anchor#tracewitness silm:hasLongDescription "The TraceWitness is the ShapeGate that validates the body-mass measurement schema (kg, range 2-12) before admission to the task node. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{TraceWitness}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
