    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_phase2_substrate.concrete_anchor#admittedclaim" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_phase2_substrate_concrete_anchor#admittedclaim silm:hasLongDescription "The AdmittedClaim is the TaskNode that records the admitted body-mass measurement as the engine's executable transformation. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{AdmittedClaim}  \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
